# A migration that re-stamps at a version other than the target it was asked
# for when it began.
MODULE: IntendedContributionBeginCapturesWrongTarget
TARGET: IntendedContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the migration captures the wrong target
PERTURBS: BeginRewrite

--- FIND
    /\ cap' = target
--- REPLACE
    /\ cap' = 2
--- END
